{
  "title": "TKA Heterotopic Ossification",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/recon/12750/tka-heterotopic-ossification",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Jun 11 2021",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "TKA Heterotopic Ossification is a complication of TKA with bone formation in the soft tissues that develops after surgery with or without a precipitating event.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be made with plain radiographs of the knee.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is observation in majority of cases as HO rarely impacts clinical outcome. Surgical excision is indicated in the presence of quadriceps muscle snapping, patellofemoral tracking difficulties, or patellofemoral instability.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Epideomiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "rates range from 1% to 42%, but less than 1% have any impact on clinical outcome",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "much less frequent than after total hip arthroplasty (THA)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Risk factors",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "4",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**hypertrophic arthrosis**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**male gender**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**obesity**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**periosteal injury/stripping** off anterior femur",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "post-op **knee effusion** or hematoma",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "post-op **forced manipulation** for restricted motion",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Pathophysiology",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "any bone formation in the soft tissues (other than periosteum) that develops after surgery with or without a precipitating event",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "distinct from myositis ossificans, which evelops after traumatic muscle injury and inflammation",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "3",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
