                  "text": "ossification along **anterior distal aspect of femur** and within quadriceps mechanism",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "typically visible 3-4 weeks post-operatively and matures within 1-2 years",
                      "table": null,
